      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Immediately take the phone out of its charging case and move it to a cool, non-flammable area away from any flammable materials. Do not attempt to puncture, squeeze, or apply any pressure to the battery. Store the device upright, ideally in a fire-resistant container, until you can properly dispose of it through an electronic waste recycling program.",
