    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i have a sand tray for these kinds of things but i'm worried about the stability. like, if the casing is already cracked or if it starts making a hissing noise, how do I deal with that? also, is there a specific way to pack it for the e-waste pickup so it doesn't cause issues during transport?",
